@startuml seq-entre-redes
actor Persona
participant "Red de origen" as Origen
participant "Circle CCTP" as Circle
participant "Wallet Core" as WC
participant "Red de destino" as Destino

Persona -> Origen : quema USDC (CCTP)
Circle -> Circle : attestation
alt destino EVM
  Circle -> Destino : el Forwarding Service acuña
else destino Stellar
  WC -> Circle : pide la attestation
  WC -> Destino : mint_and_forward a la smart account
end
note over Persona
  Desde Stellar es igual: la smart account quema
  y Circle acuña en la red EVM.
end note
@enduml
